{%- comment -%}
  Klaviyo onsite tracking for the gift card site, pointed at the main
  Twisted X Klaviyo account via its public company ID. Enables signup
  forms, popups, and active-on-site tracking — these flow into the same
  Klaviyo account as the main brand.

  Note: this is onsite/JS tracking only (signups + browsing). Full Shopify
  order/checkout sync is NOT included — Klaviyo's native Shopify integration
  is one store per account. To tell gift-card-site signups apart from the
  main store, use a dedicated Klaviyo form/list (or source) for this site.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.klaviyo_enabled and settings.klaviyo_company_id != blank -%}
  <script async type="text/javascript" src="https://static.klaviyo.com/onsite/js/{{ settings.klaviyo_company_id }}/klaviyo.js"></script>
{%- endif -%}
